flowchart TD
    subgraph CI["GitHub Actions"]
        PR["Pull request: selective affected-area gates<br/>no secrets, never publishes"]
        Main["Trusted main"]
        Image["Build, smoke and scan application<br/>scan source for secrets"]
        GHCR["Publish immutable AMD64 image<br/>commit SHA + content digest"]
        Complete["Complete integration, security<br/>and production dependency evidence"]
        PR --> Main
        Main --> Image --> GHCR
        Main --> Complete
    end

    Dispatch["Owner runs workflow on main<br/>sole human approval, exact dispatch SHA"]
    Evidence["Verify baseline, affected checks, main ancestry<br/>and exact SHA, run, attempt and digest"]
    Environment["dev secrets + main-only policy, no reviewer gate<br/>recheck the same derived evidence"]
    Connect["Ephemeral Tailscale + restricted OpenSSH<br/>check deployed baseline, then install dispatched main commit"]

    subgraph Deploy["deploy-private-dev of that commit on vgpdev (one host lock)"]
        Reconcile["Reconcile persistent services with its Compose<br/>recreate only changed ones"]
        Verify["Verify supplied revision and digest<br/>pull by digest, check OCI labels"]
        Migrate["Run the image once as the migration actor"]
        Replace["Replace only the application container<br/>with the selected digest"]
        Ready{"Candidate ready?"}
        Smoke["Deployment smoke over the private HTTPS edge<br/>browser build identity, releases, OIDC session, telemetry"]
        Record["Record JSON evidence: success or failure + phase"]
        Reconcile --> Verify --> Migrate --> Replace --> Ready
        Ready -->|yes| Smoke --> Record
        Ready -->|no| Record
    end

    Dispatch --> Evidence --> Environment --> Connect --> Reconcile
    GHCR --> Evidence
    GHCR --> Candidate["Qualify selected production SHA and digests"]
    Complete --> Candidate
    Candidate --> Approve["Separate owner dispatch and protected production approvals"]
    Manual["Owner manual deployment / assessed recovery"] --> Reconcile
    Reconcile -->|service unhealthy| Record
    Migrate -->|migration fails: previous application keeps running| Record
    Record -->|failure| Assess["Assess rollback vs forward fix<br/>an applied migration is never reverted"]
    Assess -->|schema-compatible| Verify
    Assess -->|forward fix| PR
